(sheets.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SPECIAL CONDITIONS OF CONTRACT) Tj T*
(1. Rates quoted shall be inclusive of all taxes, freight, insurance and transit risks.) Tj T*
(2. Liquidated damages at 0.5 % per week of delay shall be levied, subject to a maximum) Tj T*
