(PUBLIC WORKS DEPARTMENT — Tender EE/CIV/21/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers hostel block construction — civil and internal electrical) Tj T*
(works complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(- Exposure condition shall be considered as severe for all members.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(- Design and construction of RCC shall be in accordance with IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(- Grade of concrete for all structural members shall be M 30.) Tj T*
(- Clear cover to main reinforcement shall be 45mm for all members.) Tj T*
(- Maximum free water cement ratio shall be 0.55.) Tj T*
(- Cement content shall not be less than 320 Kg/cum of concrete.) Tj T*
(- OPC 43 grade cement as per IS 269:2015 shall be used.) Tj T*
(- Aggregates shall comply with the requirements of IS 383:2016.) Tj T*
(- High strength deformed bars of grade Fe 500D as per IS 1786:2008 shall be used.) Tj T*
(- Mix design shall be carried out in accordance with IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(- Concrete shall be kept continuously moist for at least 10 days.) Tj T*
(- Compaction shall be done by immersion vibrators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(- The internal wiring installation shall comply with IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(- Earthing arrangement of the installation shall be TN-S system.) Tj T*
(- All wiring shall be drawn through heavy gauge PVC conduits recessed in walls.) Tj T*
(- Building wires shall be 450/750 V grade PVC insulated multistrand copper conductor as) Tj T*
(per IS 694:2010.) Tj T*
(- Minimum conductor size shall be 1.5 sq.mm for lighting points and 4 sq.mm for power) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
