(- Final circuit MCBs shall be rated between 6A and 32A.) Tj T*
(- Socket outlet circuits shall be protected by 30 mA RCCBs conforming to IS 12640 \(Part) Tj T*
(1\).) Tj T*
(- The earthing system shall be designed and installed as per IS 3043:2018.) Tj T*
(- Main distribution board shall be earthed through two separate pipe earth electrodes.) Tj T*
(- Combined resistance of the earthing system shall be less than 1 ohm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
