(- Cube tests for compressive strength shall be done in accordance with IS 516 \(Part) Tj T*
(1/Sec 1\):2021.) Tj T*
(- Mill test certificates for steel and test certificates for cement shall be submitted) Tj T*
(for every consignment.) Tj T*
(- Samples of wires shall be tested as per IS 10810 at the manufacturer's works.) Tj T*
(- Tests shall be carried out on completion of the installation as per IS 732 and results) Tj T*
(recorded.) Tj T*
(- All wires, MCBs and RCCBs shall bear the BIS Standard Mark.) Tj T*
